                                "sense_id": "052c4662-7343-3622-bc4e-12f6e63e284d",
                                "text": "For on the spoile of women he doth live, / Whose bodies chast, when ever in his powre / He may them catch unable to gainstrive, / He with his shamefull lust doth first deflowre, / And afterwardes themselves doth cruelly devoure."
